  (text "POWER FLAGS (ERC)" (at 22.86 192.31999999999996 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3e749b74-626b-5cce-8b45-f3d1324b2e92)
  )
  (text "NOTES" (at 20.32 207.55999999999997 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 858086b7-241f-5143-81bb-718fac5e4cc1)
  )
  (text "1. Teensy pins use DIP-48 numbering (1-24 down the left, 25-48 up the right, USB at top). Verify against the PJRC Teensy 4.1 pinout card."
    (at 20.32 211.36999999999998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a7a0b08a-93b8-59b0-a44f-b1af73b192ca)
  )
  (text "2. Cut the VUSB-VIN trace on the Teensy so the Jetson's USB 5 V and PWR_5V_AUX never connect."
    (at 20.32 215.17999999999998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 352ae6cf-0c74-5803-ac25-16b626f2c554)
  )
  (text "3. U2/U3 use 74LVC125A at 3.3 V: inputs accept 5 V, so each RX line is safe for 3.3 V or 5 V sensors."
    (at 20.32 218.98999999999998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b0e1c341-e079-5144-895d-a2a4e7b43d68)
  )
  (text "4. Trigger/echo sensors use the same ports: TXn becomes TRIG, RXn becomes ECHO."
    (at 20.32 222.79999999999998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c820866b-4138-5211-aee2-f6a9860f9dd3)
  )
  (text "5. R41/R42 I2C pull-ups on J10 are DNP." (at 20.32 226.60999999999999 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 331a602e-afe4-58a4-a75e-28362d0e1c27)
  )

